OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped women in Fife and
OL,4,AAberdeen jailed for 13 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA violent sex offender has been jailed
OL,7,Ffor more than 13 years after raping two
OL,8,Fwomen and attacking a third victim.
OL,10,FScott Howarth, 35, carried out the
OL,11,Fattacks in Fife and Aberdeen over a
OL,12,Fperiod of 13 years.
OL,14,FHe targeted his first victim in 2011
OL,15,Fand repeatedly assaulted her in Leven,
OL,16,FBurntisland and Kirkcaldy, the High
OL,17,FCourt in Edinburgh heard.
OL,19,FJudge Lord Braid said the attacks were
OL,20,Fcommitted against a background of
OL,21,Fviolence, threats and drug misuse.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
